					</p>
				</details>

				<details class="group p-5 sm:p-6">
					<summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-[16px] font-semibold text-ink">
						<span>How many words and pages are in a 10-hour audiobook?</span>
						<span class="text-muted transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45">+</span>
					</summary>
					<p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-body">
						Using the industry-standard narration pace of <strong class="font-semibold text-ink">155 words per minute</strong> (9,300 words per hour) and <strong class="font-semibold text-ink">275 words per print page</strong>, a 10-hour audiobook equals roughly <strong class="font-semibold text-ink">93,000 words</strong> or <strong class="font-semibold text-ink">~338 printed pages</strong> (~34 pages per hour).
					</p>
				</details>

				<details class="group p-5 sm:p-6">
					<summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-[16px] font-semibold text-ink">
